    "detailed_description": "<h1>The official version of the portal is here~</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Free version of this prologue.<br>Mainly two groups of echo lands have been opened, namely &quot;Snowy Land&quot; and &quot;Crystal Mine&quot;.<br>There are 18 Echo cards in total that can be collected.<br>The highest echo depth (difficulty) that adventurers can unlock and challenge is level III.<br>The highest equipment level is open to 5 levels (common-white, excellent-green, rare-blue, epic-gold, legendary-orange).<br>The maximum character level cap is 25.<br>You can obtain up to two summoning relics.</strong><br><strong>An action independent game similar to Metroidvania and treasure hunting, it is a derivative work of Death Cells RogueLite that uses pixel rendering technology. Compared with other similar works</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/11ea0a04c607be3daf545dd43d24b5c4.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/971d6e6d51dfbfe27f4f5b71126a6b9f.poster.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/971d6e6d51dfbfe27f4f5b71126a6b9f.webm?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/971d6e6d51dfbfe27f4f5b71126a6b9f.mp4?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Create the ultimate 2D pixel-based battle experience in the name of ACT!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/6c6abf9a4250e698c5a69b6780679b4b.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/ff72bc24742d918eb7c4dbd83ad4a9ec.poster.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/ff72bc24742d918eb7c4dbd83ad4a9ec.webm?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/ff72bc24742d918eb7c4dbd83ad4a9ec.mp4?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>This world provides a variety of combinations of weapons and skills, each of which can bring different strategies and combat experiences.<br>At the same time, it also combines the characteristics of horizontal action games to create secrets for this world.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/04d5300045e26252f821e834659695be.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/bdebc306124775ec701ec2e3ae7ccee9.poster.avif?t=1755072868\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/bdebc306124775ec701ec2e3ae7ccee9.webm?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/bdebc306124775ec701ec2e3ae7ccee9.mp4?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>This world provides a wide variety of equipment affixes, which can be assembled into various attribute tactics.<br>Use such a mechanism to pay tribute to the pursuit of the sword and magic era.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/5be3916a5630e5524a0515c482163d2b.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/98e9c28a9e6aad9a4f4901a35ce87b4f.poster.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/98e9c28a9e6aad9a4f4901a35ce87b4f.webm?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/98e9c28a9e6aad9a4f4901a35ce87b4f.mp4?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>This world has both hierarchy and repeated deaths. The way of progress requires you and me to pursue.<br>Paying tribute is also progressing.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/58107d0a16fadb4cddabaa36348b3c18.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=108 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/0231464ea20fcd1ae679dd69b8646471.poster.avif?t=1755072868\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/0231464ea20fcd1ae679dd69b8646471.webm?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088420/extras/0231464ea20fcd1ae679dd69b8646471.mp4?t=1755072868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Explore and challenge this world with a tarot-style collection to fill your loot!</strong>",
